# 📊 Student Performance Dashboard (Excel Project)

## 📌 Overview
This project is a beginner-level data analysis dashboard built using Microsoft Excel. It analyzes student performance based on subject marks, attendance, and study hours, and presents key insights using formulas and charts.

---

## 📁 Dataset
The dataset includes:
- Student Name  
- Maths, Science, English marks (out of 100)  
- Attendance (%)  
- Study Hours  

---

## ⚙️ Features Implemented

### 📊 Data Processing
- Total Marks calculation  
- Percentage calculation  
- Grade assignment using IF conditions  
- Pass/Fail classification  

---

### 📈 Analysis
- Subject-wise performance summary (Average, Max, Min)  
- Top 5 students based on percentage  
- Key Performance Indicators (KPI):
  - Total Students  
  - Average Percentage  
  - Top Performer  
  - Lowest Performer  
  - Pass Percentage  

---

### 📉 Visualization
- Bar chart: Top 5 Students by Percentage  
- Bar chart: Average Marks per Subject  

---

## 🧠 Key Excel Concepts Used
- IF function (nested conditions)  
- AVERAGE, MAX, MIN  
- COUNTIF  
- Table formatting  
- Sorting & Filtering  
- Charts (Bar/Column)  

---

## 📌 Dashboard Highlights
- Clean separation of data and dashboard  
- Dynamic calculations using formulas  
- Visual representation of insights  

---

## 🚀 Learning Outcome
This project helped in understanding:
- Basic data analysis workflow  
- Excel-based dashboard creation  
- Data visualization techniques  

---

## ⚠️ Note
This is a beginner-level project created for learning purposes and as a stepping stone towards Data Analytics.

